-- numbering finds the failures --
send 0
  got 0, in order
send 1
  got 1, in order
send 2
send 3
  got 3: gap, 2 never arrived
send 4
  got 4, in order
  got 4 again, dropped
send 5
  got 5, in order

-- acks tell the sender --
send 0: ack "have 0 through 0"
send 1: ack "have 0 through 1"
send 2: no ack came back
send 3: ack "have 0 through 1"
send 4: ack "have 0 through 1"
send 4: ack "have 0 through 1"
send 5: ack "have 0 through 1"

sender: confirmed through 1, so 2 through 5 need resending
